2","number":22,"lesson":3,"part":"text","answer":"B","points":1,"type":"listeningMonologueChoice","options":{"A":"卖灯的人","B":"楼上的朋友","C":"自己的家人"}},{"id":"HSK3-C04-L-23","number":23,"lesson":4,"part":"text","answer":"A","points":1,"type":"listeningMonologueChoice","options":{"A":"价钱低","B":"离海更近","C":"房间大"}},{"id":"HSK3-C04-L-24","number":24,"lesson":5,"part":"text","answer":"C","points":1,"type":"listeningMonologueChoice","options":{"A":"先看价钱","B":"问朋友","C":"先试一试"}},{"id":"HSK3-C04-L-25","number":25,"lesson":1,"part":"text","answer":"B","points":1,"type":"listeningMonologueChoice","options":{"A":"把箱子换成白色","B":"写了名字","C":"少带东西"}},{"id":"HSK3-C04-L-26","number":26,"lesson":6,"part":"text","answer":"B","points":1,"type":"listeningMonologueChoice","options":{"A":"大的充电宝","B":"小的充电宝","C":"新手机"}},{"id":"HSK3-C04-L-27","number":27,"lesson":3,"part":"text","answer":"A","points":1,"type":"listeningMonologueChoice","options":{"A":"楼上的电视没声音了","B":"电视声音更大","C":"孩子开始看电视"}},{"id":"HSK3-C04-L-28","number":28,"lesson":2,"part":"text","answer":"A","points":1,"type":"listeningMonologueChoice","options":{"A":"二十分钟","B":"四十分钟","C":"一小时"}},{"id":"HSK3-C04-L-29","number":29,"lesson":5,"part":"text","answer":"C","points":1,"type":"listeningMonologueChoice","options":{"A":"朋友的大衣","B":"黑色的","C":"蓝色的"}},{"id":"HSK3-C04-L-30","number":30,"lesson":4,"part":"text","answer":"B","points":1,"type":"listeningMonologueChoice","options":{"A":"相机太贵","B":"想买的已经卖完了","C":"店里没开门"}}],"audioParts":[{"part":1,"file":"assets/audio/c04-l1.mp3","durationSeconds":269.57},{"part":2,"file":"assets/audio/c04-l2.mp3?v=20261126","durationSeconds":479.2},{"part":3,"file":"assets/audio/c04-l3.mp3?v=20261126","durationSeconds":536.94}]},"reading":{"materials":{"HSK3-C04-R-M1":{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-M1","type":"sentencePool","options":{"A":"别着急，我带了另一张卡。","B":"放在冰箱里，明天早上再喝。","C":"我帮你问一下吧。","D":"他刚到楼下，马上就上来。","E":"就在咱们小区南门旁边。","F":"外面冷，你还是穿上吧。"}},"HSK3-C04-R-M2":{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-M2","type":"sentencePool","options":{"A":"你来这里住多久了？","B":"你觉得这家店的外卖怎么样？","C":"刚才谁给你打电话了？","D":"这次坐火车的票买好了吗？","E":"你为什么去得那么早？"}},"HSK3-C04-R-V1":{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-V1","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"站","B":"终于","C":"冰箱","D":"卡","E":"南","F":"旁边"}},"HSK3-C04-R-V2":{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-V2","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"谢谢","B":"越","C":"附近","D":"提前","E":"换","F":"外卖"}},"HSK3-C04-R-T57":{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-T57","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"周末我和爸爸去接表哥。起初我觉得离家近的是这座城的北站，就坐车去了那里。到了以后，表哥才发消息说他在南站。爸爸让我留在北站买点水，他去南站接人。后来我们说好了，先到家的人在小区门口等。"},"HSK3-C04-R-T59":{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-T59","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"上周我们请新搬来的王阿姨一家来家里吃饭。本来想从饭店叫几个菜，后来妈妈说还是做自己家常吃的菜。到了晚上，王阿姨带来一些自己做的蛋糕，还教我们做了一道菜。吃完饭，妈妈约她下次一起来学做蛋糕。"}},"examples":{"EM":{"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M1","prompt":"送外卖的人到了没有？","answer":"D"},"EV1":{"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V1","prompt":"我过了马路，很快就到了火车（　）。","answer":"A"},"EV2":{"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V2","prompt":"甲：我帮你把行李拿过来了。／乙：太（　）你了。","answer":"A"},"E3":{"passage":"我拿了一张地图，问工作人员怎么去南门。他说坐电梯到一楼就能看见，我就把地图放进了包里。","question":"坐电梯到几楼能看见南门？","options":{"A":"二楼","B":"一楼","C":"三楼"},"answer":"B"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-31","number":31,"lesson":5,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M1","prompt":"你说我出门要不要穿大衣？","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-32","number":32,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M1","prompt":"新开的商店在哪儿？","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-33","number":33,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M1","prompt":"为什么这张银行卡不能用了？","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-34","number":34,"lesson":6,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M1","prompt":"我不知道从哪个门出去。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-35","number":35,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M1","prompt":"这半瓶牛奶还能留到明天吗？","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-36","number":36,"lesson":6,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M2","prompt":"买好了，不过我得从北站上车。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-37","number":37,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M2","prompt":"是楼下的李阿姨，她请我们今晚去她家吃饭。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-38","number":38,"lesson":6,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M2","prompt":"我怕路上车多，错过了火车。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-39","number":39,"lesson":2,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M2","prompt":"挺好吃的，就是送得有点儿慢。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-40","number":40,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-M2","prompt":"下个月就满一年了。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-41","number":41,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V1","prompt":"洗好的水果已经放进（　）了。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-42","number":42,"lesson":6,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V1","prompt":"请问，去（　）门怎么走？","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-43","number":43,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V1","prompt":"看病以前要先给工作人员看看你的（　）。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-44","number":44,"lesson":6,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V1","prompt":"等了快两个小时，她（　）到了。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-45","number":45,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V1","prompt":"学校（　）新开了一家商店。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-46","number":46,"lesson":6,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V2","prompt":"甲：什么时候去车站？／乙：这次要（　）半个小时到。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-47","number":47,"lesson":2,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V2","prompt":"甲：等会儿我们出去吃饭？／乙：我还在开会，今天叫（　）吧。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-48","number":48,"lesson":6,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V2","prompt":"甲：这趟车赶不上了。／乙：我帮你看看能不能（　）下一趟的票。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-49","number":49,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V2","prompt":"甲：这（　）有地方买水果吗？／乙：出门往左走就是。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-50","number":50,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-V2","prompt":"甲：这里住得还习惯吗？／乙：挺好的，我（　）住越喜欢。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-51","number":51,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"车站南门离买票的地方更近，但那边现在走不了。来接我的人已经到了北门，我就带着两个大包走到北门去。","question":"他去北门做什么？","options":{"A":"接人","B":"买车票","C":"找来接他的人"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-52","number":52,"lesson":3,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"妈妈把鸡蛋和牛奶都放进冰箱，把刚买的面包留在桌上。她说晚上饿了可以吃面包，鸡蛋明天早上再做。","question":"什么东西在桌上？","options":{"A":"面包","B":"鸡蛋","C":"牛奶"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-53","number":53,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"今天风太大，我在车站门口等了几分钟，就走进了大厅。我告诉弟弟，我在里面的大门旁边等他，让他到了就过来。","question":"他最后在哪里等弟弟？","options":{"A":"车站里面的大门旁边","B":"车站外","C":"买票的地方"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-54","number":54,"lesson":2,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"上个月我一回到家就想叫外卖。这个月我学着自己做饭，想吃什么就自己做，饿了也不用等着别人送饭。今天我还请了朋友来吃。","question":"他这个月有什么变化？","options":{"A":"更喜欢叫外卖","B":"常请朋友送饭","C":"开始自己做饭"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-55","number":55,"lesson":5,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"我在店里试了两件大衣，灰色那件比黑色的轻一些，穿起来也更合适。我原来想买黑色的，最后还是选了灰色的。","question":"他最后买了什么？","options":{"A":"灰色大衣","B":"黑色大衣","C":"两件大衣"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-56","number":56,"lesson":3,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"我们小区以前只有西门能进出，上个月又开了南门。现在李阿姨买菜不用绕到西门，走出南门没多远就到了。","question":"南门打开后，李阿姨觉得怎么样？","options":{"A":"西门离她更近了","B":"买菜更方便了","C":"买菜得走更远了"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-57","number":57,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-T57","question":"“我”为什么先去了北站？","options":{"A":"觉得北站离家近","B":"表哥在北站等","C":"爸爸要去买水"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-58","number":58,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-T57","question":"爸爸后来去哪儿了？","options":{"A":"北站","B":"南站","C":"小区门口"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-59","number":59,"lesson":2,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-T59","question":"他们的晚饭是怎么准备的？","options":{"A":"全都从饭店订","B":"在家里自己做","C":"从饭店订了一道"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-R-60","number":60,"lesson":2,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C04-R-T59","question":"妈妈下次想学什么？","options":{"A":"做鸡蛋","B":"做一道菜","C":"做蛋糕"},"answer":"C"}]},"writing":{"examples":{"pinyinCharacter":{"prompt":"请把你的东西（　）在这儿。","pinyin":"fàng","answer":"放"},"pictureSentence":{"word":"看书","image":"assets/images/w-example.jpg","answer":"小男孩正在看书。"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-61","number":61,"lesson":5,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"这件大（　）太重了，出门还是穿那件轻一点儿的吧。","pinyin":"yī","answer":"衣","reference":"这件大衣太重了，出门还是穿那件轻一点儿的吧。"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-62","number":62,"lesson":6,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"把你的学生（　）给工作人员看一下。","pinyin":"kǎ","answer":"卡","reference":"把你的学生卡给工作人员看一下。"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-63","number":63,"lesson":3,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"今天新开的店在小区（　）门外。","pinyin":"nán","answer":"南","reference":"今天新开的店在小区南门外。"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-64","number":64,"lesson":3,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"水果洗好后，我把它们放进了（　）箱。","pinyin":"bīng","answer":"冰","reference":"水果洗好后，我把它们放进了冰箱。"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-65","number":65,"lesson":6,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"吃完饭以后，我等了很（　）才坐上车。","pinyin":"jiǔ","answer":"久","reference":"吃完饭以后，我等了很久才坐上车。"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-66","number":66,"lesson":3,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"银行卡","image":"assets/images/c04-w-66.jpg","reference":"她在用银行卡付钱。"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-67","number":67,"lesson":5,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"大衣","image":"assets/images/c04-w-67.jpg","reference":"爸爸正在帮孩子穿大衣。"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-68","number":68,"lesson":3,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"冰箱","image":"assets/images/c04-w-68.jpg","reference":"孩子把牛奶放进冰箱里。"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-69","number":69,"lesson":2,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"外卖","image":"assets/images/c04-w-69.jpg","reference":"他在办公室收到了外卖。"},{"id":"HSK3-C04-W-70","number":70,"lesson":6,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"问路","image":"assets/images/c04-w-70.jpg","reference":"他在车站向工作人员问